-- test: in edition 0.5, `add` and `remove` update a bit set written `edit b.add(...)`, as the whole expression of a statement; its items are `Int`, the other operand of a set operation is a `BitSet`, and each method takes its number of labeled arguments (ADR 0119 rule 14)
-- spec: spec/28 §9
-- expect: error U2020 at src/wrong.una:15:3
-- expect: error U3013 at src/wrong.una:16:18
